  "question": {
    "text": "An equimolar mixture of toluene and chlorobenzene is treated with a mixture of conc. $\\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{SO}_{4}$ and conc. $\\mathrm{HNO}_{3}$. Indicate the correct statement from the following.",
    "image": null
