  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/2012_che_a35.png\">\r\n\r\nAs toluene and chlorobenzene, both can react with mixture of conc. $\\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{SO}_{4}$ and conc. HNO $_{3}$. but being more reactive, toluene will yield p-nitrotoluene in excess.",
